   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 3,000eb<br>\n<strong>Enhances:</strong> Skinweave or Subdermal Armor<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> 0 (Cyberware Enhancement)</p>\n<p>Enhances Skinweave or Subdermal Armor, raising the enhanced armor's SP by 1. It can't raise the SP of Dragoon Plating. This version fits Subdermal Armor at SP 13 or higher.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Corgo prices this by the armor's SP, so it comes as two items.</li>\n<li>Change the SP on the armor item by hand; an upgrade installed in cyberware can't do it.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; External Body Cyberware).</em></p>"
